Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 11:44:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 12/18] Image sources, masks and fills print a Url once and
 take typed Gradient values, transition properties and try-fallbacks take
 identifiers, and clip-path path data is quoted once
 (swift-w3c/swift-w3c-css#13)

